WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Soteria SECP landing page: the cognitive operating system for modern organizations.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
An operator signs in at the credential checkpoint to reach Mission Control.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Mission Control shows cognitive load, active specialists, and the executive council grid.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Layer one indexes organizational identity, entities, and the knowledge corpus.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Documents and managed connectors feed the ingestion pipeline into layer one.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Eleven AI officers reason over strategy, each with autonomy level and cognitive load.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Domain consultants supply deep expertise on demand across fifteen practices.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Programs break work down into workstreams, acceptance criteria, and a risk register.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.000
The specialist workforce executes tasks under autonomy policy.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Validator batteries score accuracy and completeness, and log every decision to the audit trail.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The request queue tracks active directives through the twelve-stage reasoning pipeline.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Operators log lessons and outcome ratings that tune future reasoning.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The archetype forge defines new specialist roles and domain packs without redesign.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
The knowledge graph visualizes over one million edges between organizational entities.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Data residency, PII redaction, and SOC 2 style evidence are managed in one surface.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.800
Retention windows and compliant purges close the governance loop.
